#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/datetime.xml line 60
#: xml_doc.cpp:597
msgid ""
"The TIMEVALUE() function returns a number (between 0 and 1) representing the "
"time of day."
msgstr ""
"Fungsi TIMEVALUE() mengembalikan nombor (antara 0 dan 1) yang mewakili masa "
"bagi satu hari."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/datetime.xml line 61
#: xml_doc.cpp:600
msgid "TIMEVALUE(time)"
msgstr "TIMEVALUE(masa)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/datetime.xml line 62
#: xml_doc.cpp:603
msgid "TIMEVALUE(\"10:05:02\") returns 0.42"
msgstr "TIMEVALUE(\"10:05:02\") mengembalikan 0.42"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/datetime.xml line 75
#: xml_doc.cpp:609
msgid ""
"The DATEVALUE function returns a number representing the day, i.e the number "
"of days elapsed since December 31, 1899."
msgstr ""
"Fungsi DATEVALUE mengembalikan nombor yang mewakili hari, iaitu bilangan "
"hari yang berlalu sejak 31 Disember, 1899."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/datetime.xml line 76
#: xml_doc.cpp:612
msgid "DATEVALUE(date)"
msgstr "DATEVALUE(tarikh)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/datetime.xml line 77
#: xml_doc.cpp:615
msgid "DATEVALUE(\"2/22/2002\") returns 37309"
msgstr "DATEVALUE(\"2/22/2002\") mengembalikan 37309"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/datetime.xml line 90
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/datetime.xml line 111
#: xml_doc.cpp:621 xml_doc.cpp:639
msgid "Months"
msgstr "Bulan"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/datetime.xml line 94
#: xml_doc.cpp:624
msgid ""
"The EDATE functions returns the date that is specified by a given date and a "
"number of months before or after that date."
msgstr ""
"Fungi EDATE mengembalikan tarikh yang ditetapkan oleh tarikh dan nombor "
"bulan sebelum atau selepas tarikh itu. "

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/datetime.xml line 95
#: xml_doc.cpp:627
msgid "EDATE(date; months)"
msgstr "EDATE(tarikh; bulan)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/datetime.xml line 96
#: xml_doc.cpp:630
msgid "EDATE(\"2/22/2002\"; 3) returns \"5/22/2002\""
msgstr "EDATE(\"2/22/2002\"; 3) mengembalikan \"5/22/2002\""

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/datetime.xml line 97
#: xml_doc.cpp:633
msgid "EDATE(\"3/31/2002\"; -1) returns \"2/28/2002\""
msgstr "EDATE(\"3/31/2002\"; -1) mengembalikan \"2/28/2002\""

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/datetime.xml line 115
#: xml_doc.cpp:642
msgid ""
"The EOMONTH functions returns the last day in the month specified by a date "
"and the number of months from that date."
msgstr ""
"Fungsi EOMONTH mengembalikan hari terakhir dalam bulan yang ditetapkan oleh "
"tarikh dan nombor bulan dari tarikh itu. "

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/datetime.xml line 116
#: xml_doc.cpp:645
msgid "EOMONTH(date; months)"
msgstr "EOMONTH(tarikh; bulan)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/datetime.xml line 117
#: xml_doc.cpp:648
msgid "EOMONTH(\"2/22/2002\"; 3) returns \"5/31/2002\""
msgstr "EOMONTH(\"2/22/2002\"; 3) mengembalikan \"5/31/2002\""

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/datetime.xml line 118
#: xml_doc.cpp:651
msgid "EOMONTH(\"3/12/2002\"; -1) returns \"2/28/2002\""
msgstr "EOMONTH(\"3/12/2002\"; -1) mengembalikan \"2/28/2002\""

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/datetime.xml line 119
#: xml_doc.cpp:654
msgid "EOMONTH(\"3/12/2002\"; 0) returns \"3/31/2002\""
msgstr "EOMONTH(\"3/12/2002\"; 0) mengembalikan \"3/31/2002\""

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/datetime.xml line 133
#: xml_doc.cpp:660
msgid ""
"The YEAR functions returns the year of a date. If no parameter is specified "
"the current year gets returned."
msgstr ""
"Fungsi YEAR mengembalikan tahun bagi satu tarikh. Jika tiada parameter "
