msgstr "Kadar faedah pasaran"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/financial.xml line 733
#: xml_doc.cpp:2583
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The LEVEL_COUPON() function calculates the value of a level-coupon bond. For "
"example: if the interest rate is 10%, a $1000 bond with semi-annual coupons "
"at a rate of 13% that matures in 4 years is worth LEVEL_COUPON"
"(1000;.13;2;4;.1) or $1096.95."
msgstr ""
"Fungsi LEVEL_COUPON() mengira nilai bon kupon rata. Sebagai contoh: jika "
"kadar faedah 10%, bon $1000 dengan kupon setengah tahunan pada kadar 13% "
"yang matang dalam tempoh 4 tahun bernilai LEVEL_COUPON(1000;.13;2;4;.1) atau "
"$1096.95."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/financial.xml line 734
#: xml_doc.cpp:2586
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "LEVEL_COUPON(face value;rate;years)"
msgid "LEVEL_COUPON(face value;coupon rate;coupons per year;years;market rate)"
msgstr "LEVEL_COUPON(nilai muka;kadar;tahun)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/financial.xml line 735
#: xml_doc.cpp:2589
msgid "LEVEL_COUPON(1000;.13;2;4;.1) equals 1096.95"
msgstr "LEVEL_COUPON(1000;.13;2;4;.1) sama dengan 1096.95"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/financial.xml line 767
#: xml_doc.cpp:2610
msgid ""
"The MDURATION() function will calculate the modified Macauley duration of a "
"fixed interest security in years."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/financial.xml line 768
#: xml_doc.cpp:2613
#, fuzzy
msgid "MDURATION( Settlement; Maturity; Coupon; Yield; Frequency; [ Basis=0 ])"
msgstr "COUPNUM(penyelesaian, kematangan, frekuensi, asas)"

