#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 491
#: xml_doc.cpp:6991
msgid "LOWER(\"HELLO\") returns \"hello\""
msgstr "LOWER(\"HELLO\") mengembalikan \"hello\""

#. i18n: tag Comment
