"The SINH() function returns the hyperbolic sine of x, which is defined "
"mathematically as (exp(x) - exp(-x)) / 2."
msgstr ""
"Fungsi SINH() mengembalikan sinus hiperbolik x, yang ditakrifkan secara "
"matematik sebagai (exp(x) - (exp(-x)) / 2."

